    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d609">

                <pb facs="0757" n="665" xml:id="pg665"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/1239</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-05T12:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 5, 1918, noon</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received 5.45 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My January 12, 1 p.m.,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d609-f1"/> and January 25, 6 p.m. The
                    President received the Mexican mission in farewell audience yesterday. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">La Nacion</hi> of today states that Cabrera will visit
                    Paraguay and will then return to Argentine where he will visit the central and
                    western provinces and that he will then visit Chile, Peru and Bolivia. It
                    further states that one delegate, General Montes, will visit Chile and supposed
                    another, Ugarte, Ecuador. [E. Hidalgo?] will visit Brazil. The Mexican mission
                    has not been received at any diplomatic functions and none of the mission has
                    called at this Embassy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
